WEBVTT

00:03:28.371 --> 00:03:31.746
The conventional view of emotions
as good or bad,

00:03:32.163 --> 00:03:36.454
positive or negative is
rigid and rigidity in

00:03:36.454 --> 00:03:38.621
the face of complexity is toxic.

00:03:39.746 --> 00:03:44.996
We need greater levels of emotional
agility for true resilience and thriving.

00:03:46.996 --> 00:03:51.663
My journey with his calling began not in
the hallowed halls of a university,

00:03:52.288 --> 00:03:54.204
but in the messy, tender business of life,

00:03:55.371 --> 00:03:58.371
I grew up in the white suburbs
of apartheid South Africa,

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:03.288
a country and community committed
to not seeing, to denial,